<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.handle.verifies ~ the chain half of an attestation: did the Handle say it

`lares handle verify-attestation <statement | @file | ->` checks the chain half of a statement `lares handle attest` printed, reader-locally: the chain comes from a carried card (`card=<file>`) or the acting face's handle-book (`face=N`), and the answer says whether it verifies, stands unburned, matches the prefix and seats the head that signed. A pass says the Handle said it, never that the claim holds in the world: the surface half stays out of scope. An unmet Handle with no card refuses `not-found`.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ file · book

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`file` params=`statement/@statement.json card/card.json ~ verify against a carried card`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`book` params=`statement/@statement.json ~ verify against the handle-book`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ statement · card · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`statement` params=`takes/statement needs/required seat/1 as/<statement> ~ the statement JSON, @file, or - for stdin`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`card` params=`takes/host-path ~ the Handle's carried card, its chain beside it`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the face whose handle-book answers; absent, the one face standing open`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ read

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`read` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ reads a card or the handle-book; nothing dials out`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · not-found · verb-error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.handle.verifies statement/@statement.json]] ~ the statement reads as no JSON, lacks prefix, headEventCid or sig, or names no structured claim; a card names another Handle or no chain`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`not-found` params=`cure/[[face.handle.verifies statement/@statement.json card/card.json]] ~ this vessel never met the Handle; carry its card`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`verb-error` params=`~ the chain refused the statement; the reason rides the answer`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ holds · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`holds` params=`exit/0 fields/[[verdict prefix claim claimSurface claimSubject headEventCid chainSource chainVerify surfaceVerify]] ~ the Handle said it; surfaceVerify reads out-of-scope`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/1 fields/[[verdict reason prefix claim]] ~ the chain refused`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares handle verify-attestation

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares handle verify-attestation]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

